'''Eyeless Ones''' are hostile creatures found in the [[Winding Tunnels]] below ground in the [[Deep North]].

== Drops ==
{{CreatureDrops}}

==Spawning==
{{Spawn table|
{{spawn row|type=Spawn point in [[Winding Tunnels]]|limit=1|frequency=0|stars=Yes}}
}}

An Eyeless One appears with a wake-up animation when a player comes within 10 meters of its spawn point. Each spawn point spawns only one Eyeless One and does not respawn it.

== Attacks and abilities ==
=== Sand cloud ===
Launches six projectiles, each dealing 60 [[Damage types#Blunt|Blunt]] damage. Eyeless Ones prefer this attack whenever it is available. It can be used every 10 seconds when within 15 meters of a target.

=== Claw ===
Deals 80 Blunt, 40 [[Damage types#Slash|Slash]] and 100 [[Damage types#Poison|Poison]] damage in a 2-meter, 90-degree horizontal arc. There are two claw attacks with the same damage, each with its own 2-second cooldown. They can be used when within 2 meters of a target.

